            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Late-arriving claims & period close\n",
                "Late claim facts never re-post a **closed** period: the difference between what a claim now requires and what was booked becomes a **PRIOR_PERIOD_ADJ** in the open booking period, or a **LATE_ADJ** when its origin period is still open. Every line keeps its `origin_period`, which drives the restated view.\n"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
